        "original_id": "a0840eaa-10f9-5901-8cc5-61a17bb63161",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Joseph Morgan, Gonzalo López-Gallego, Sharlto Copley, Thomas Kretschmann, Erin Richards, Josie Ho, Taylor Kinney\n- Roles: Klaus Mikaelson, Mason Lockwood, Jonah Cooke, Jared, Kelly Severide\n- Products: The Vampire Diaries, The Originals, Open Grave, Zero Dark Thirty, Chicago Fire, Chicago P.D., Chicago Med\n- Concepts: Original vampires\n\nFacts:\n- Joseph Morgan was born as Joseph Martin on 16 May 1981 and is an English actor and director.\n- Joseph Morgan is best known for playing Klaus Mikaelson in The CW series The Vampire Diaries and its spin-off The Originals.\n- In the universes of The Vampire Diaries and The Originals, the Original vampires are a family of vampires from which all current vampires descend.\n- In the universes of The Vampire Diaries and The Originals, the Original vampires are the most powerful and indestructible vampires of their kind.\n- Open Grave is a 2013 post-apocalyptic zombie-like suspense film directed by Gonzalo López-Gallego.\n- Open Grave stars Sharlto Copley as Jonah Cooke and features Thomas Kretschmann, Joseph Morgan, Erin Richards, and Josie Ho in supporting roles.\n- Taylor Kinney is known for playing Mason Lockwood in The Vampire Diaries, Jared in Zero Dark Thirty, and Lieutenant Kelly Severide in Chicago Fire, Chicago P.D., and Chicago Med.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
